{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"e53bda62d96d5a9ed1a3f31a8d639c335af2acaf40d06c843644be34a396952a","ja":"ふたりを探して","zh":"寻找两人","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"66e85bde596563d942df904e107ac49d11d8f5c5adafb6d2d9a98077efec517f","ja":"あっ、このアクセサリー、かわいいかも♪\n買っちゃおっかな～♪","zh":"啊，这个饰品，说不定很可爱呢♪\n要不要买下来呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2014476b1515030cb4bc851811b6b3578055faed3497b442cb48ea6024668e95","ja":"あら、翼だけ？　未来は一緒じゃなかったの？","zh":"哎呀，只有翼一个人？未来没和你一起吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"804ac7120fe9448d57ff5194810387d0ad4aa981c4e1f1b36b3b580535ac08cf","ja":"うん、私ひとりだよ。未来なら、\nさっき屋上で練習してくるって言ってたかも。","zh":"嗯，就我一个人。要是未来的话，刚才可能会说要去屋顶练习来着。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"aabd567e55c23e75d8248308e58280e6b8052d102166aee30427a46af102d999","ja":"そうなんだ？　……ところで、翼は\nレッスンしないで、どうして雑誌を読んでるの？","zh":"原来是这样？……话说回来，翼不去训练，为什么在看杂志？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"65f760fb3847f975cf187d283e8907ca9ae93cf8ed6a7a03c2e8b5b0693a5b91","ja":"えへへへ……。だって、もうカンペキに覚えたし、\nちょっとくらい、休憩してもいいかな～……って。","zh":"嘿嘿嘿……因为我已经完全记住了，稍微休息一下应该也没关系吧～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"00139d718974fabd7f0ac09866597e2fe154e1657a1b8b8883969903b014a9ea","ja":"もう、しょうがないわね……。\nまあいいわ。一緒に未来を呼びに行きましょ。","zh":"真是拿你没办法……  \n好吧。我们一起去叫未来吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"41ff48c266a259fb8182708806dcbd7e4b59779b81d25982201a7aeabec2063a","ja":"えっ？　わたしも？","zh":"咦？我也要？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c3828e699a236bcb6b1cfeb818ef672296f9e691f7605952c5304fc91df9e9f5","ja":"ふたりとも、ちょっと目を離すと\nすぐにどこか行っちゃうじゃない。","zh":"两个人只要一不留神，就马上跑到什么地方去了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b178ed1092dc856f73d5dc7b18fd1366f5569f126f7690783417bea788609243","ja":"未来を捕まえたら翼がいない、\nなんてことになったら困るもの。","zh":"要是抓住了未来，却发现翼不在，那可就麻烦了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0d2a19c27568711c47980a18fddcbfe3813e2b45ea12af26df8cf15bc9df32de","ja":"ん～……私はそんなことないと\n思うんだけどなー。","zh":"嗯～……我觉得倒不是那样啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_876.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"caffd328e762f2c60ddb8de4502a5f95a745df21239d8fab2b5e6bd118e5c22f","ja":"まあ、でも別にいいよ。気分転換したかったし。\nじゃ、行こっか♪","zh":"不过，也没什么啦。正好我也想换换心情。\n那，走吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
